      "t": "Что случилось, Витя?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened, Vitya?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Префект не наелся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The prefect did not eat his fill.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Миша, ты меня прости, что я тогда Элеоноре ничего не сказал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Misha, forgive me for not saying anything to Eleonora back then.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты пойми, для нее это важно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understand, for her it is important.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mikhail",
      "t": "Никаких проблем, Витя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No problem at all, Vitya.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "За новое меню и за звезду!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To the new menu and to the star!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mikhail",
      "t": "Катя уже третий бокал пьет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Katya is already drinking her third glass.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "katya",
      "t": "По-моему, пора идти.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In my opinion, it is time to go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mikhail",
      "t": "Давай, удачи.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go ahead, good luck.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "katya",
      "t": "Ну что, думаешь, пора уже с Катей поговорить?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, do you think it is time to talk to Katya already?'",
